### Lab 1 - Cisco Router Basic Commands

Configured and verified core Cisco IOS administration and access-security features:

- Changed the router hostname.
- Configured console access and local user authentication.
- Protected privileged EXEC mode using an enable password/secret.
- Configured VTY access for Telnet and SSH.
- Enabled password encryption and login banners.
- Assigned an IP address to a router interface and verified reachability with `ping`.
